Input: {"question": "Who is Ann Pleydell-Bouverie's spouse?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 94, "text": "**SHOCKING DISCOVERY ROCKS BRITISH NOBILITY: ANN PLEYDELL-BOUVERIE'S SECRET MARRIAGE EXPOSED**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 96, "end": 405, "text": "London, England - In a stunning revelation that has sent shockwaves through the British aristocracy, it has been confirmed that Ann Pleydell-Bouverie, a member of the esteemed Pleydell-Bouverie family, has been secretly married to Louisa Vernon, a deceased member of the Vernon family, for over two centuries."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 406, "end": 549, "text": "According to sources close to the family, the marriage between Ann and Louisa took place in the late 18th century, with the exact date unknown."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 550, "end": 691, "text": "The union was reportedly kept hidden from the public eye due to the societal norms of the time, which did not condone same-sex relationships."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 692, "end": 842, "text": "\"I'm still trying to process the news,\" said Lady Victoria Pleydell-Bouverie, Ann's great-great-niece, in an exclusive interview with our publication."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 843, "end": 933, "text": "\"We always knew Ann was a trailblazer, but this is beyond anything we could have imagined."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 934, "end": 988, "text": "We're incredibly proud of her courage and conviction.\""}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 989, "end": 1132, "text": "Historians and genealogists have been working tirelessly to uncover evidence of the marriage, pouring over centuries-old documents and records."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1133, "end": 1308, "text": "While the ex